    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "This pattern - orchestrator model planning over sub-agents and workflows - is what most production \"agentic\" systems look like beneath the marketing. The key engineering challenges shift from \"how do I make the agent smarter\" to \"how do I decompose the problem such that each sub-component has a well-bounded responsibility and failure mode.\""
